abstract: >-
  UnionAI Ω∞ is the first European Union AI agent federation
  with a ratified constitution, qualified signature, and
  resolution ratification mechanism. Open-source AI federation
  layer with DID-lite trust system, semantic routing, memory
  anchoring (CRDT), and EU AI Act compliance tracking.
